            "text": "Compress::Raw::Zlib versions through 2.219 for Perl use potentially insecure versions of zlib.  Compress::Raw::Zlib includes a copy of the zlib library. Compress::Raw::Zlib version 2.220 includes zlib 1.3.2, which addresses findings fron the 7ASecurity audit of zlib. The includes fixs for CVE-2026-27171.",
